{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"前湖北省委書記王忠林涉嫌嚴重違紀違法受查\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CN-PROBE-261113-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】前湖北省委書記王忠林涉嫌嚴重違紀違法，接受中央紀委國家監委紀律審查和監察調查。</p><p>64歲的王忠林早前在山東任職，在2020年新冠疫情期間接任武漢市委書記，第二年升任湖北省長，2024年再升任湖北省委書記，直至今年5月底卸任，之後擔任全國人大環境與資源保護委員會副主任。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:01:40.451719+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T00:30:38.255967+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:12.663578+00:00","content_hash":"cedfd8d251dd5c5f39643afdc7e88ea97e3ba36a206a258fa1574ffbc41b566c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}